BEATLES II

The London Sun is reporting that before the end of the year the
remaining Beatles will release a new song using previously recorded
vocals by John Lennon.  The song called "We're Not Home Right Now, Leave
a Message After the Beep," will be out in June.  (Colin Quinn on
Saturday Night Live)

